<title>INDIA: CRICKET - SOUTH AFRICA 428, INDIA 70-1 AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - SOUTH AFRICA 428, INDIA 70-1 AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 70 for one in reply to South Africa's first innings 428 at tea on the second day of the second test on Thursday.</p>
</text>
